WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:12.000
Zava is a working reference for an agentic organisation.
This walkthrough shows an actual recorded Aurora execution.

00:12.000 --> 00:27.000
The business records are synthetic.
A real model produced the bounded budget recommendation.

00:27.000 --> 00:43.000
The workflow waited for an operator decision before applying policy.
The operator interface was exercised by automation in this local proof.

00:43.000 --> 00:59.000
The approved policy has a decision ID.
Two real AP invoice workflows completed with their own execution records.

00:59.000 --> 01:15.000
Open a child workflow to inspect lookup, matching and decision history.
Automatic child reviewers are synthetic personae, not real employees.

01:15.000 --> 01:31.000
No real payments or customer-system changes were made.
Existing systems connect at the same declared tool and policy boundaries.

01:31.000 --> 01:42.480
Development walkthrough: native local execution, not an Azure release.
Clean-source publication and human seller approval remain separate gates.
